{"channelId":"UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","row":["Vetahead",1400,"Teaching veterinary professionals to treat ZooMed (exotic) pets. By Dr Laila Proença\n\nVETAHEAD is your one-stop platform for everything you need to treat ZooMed (exotic) pets. Literally everything. It’s like Google, YouTube, and a chat GPT, all together, but evidence-based — made just for veterinary professionals working with birds, reptiles, and mammals. You’ll get video lessons, live events, journal clubs, topic rounds, quick-reference guides, e-books, medical calculators, an exclusive anatomic atlas, and the amazing Coco, our evidence-based AI assistant, trained by the one and only, Dr. Proença (MV, MS, PhD, DVM, DACZM), ready to help you with your cases 24/7 and in any language. Whether you're a vet, nurse, tech, or student, VETAHEAD gives you the tools, knowledge, and support to feel confident in treating ZooMed (exotic) patients —anytime you need it, with no fear.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:53.590Z","channelId":"UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7bbe67f82dcb0382515a97e164cf6004b26a4563618dbe80d36a447c06c691bc","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b7ea91f691fbd4d5343743a7a67606e3bc7c57b96383545397914999ef9e3c78"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:53.590Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1400,"raw":"1.4K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS0irRjbx1UXe495jo7l5GA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:53.590Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"vet